{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20213","headline":"李少府厅吊李元宾遗字 · 孟郊","name":"李少府厅吊李元宾遗字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"零落三四字，忽成千万年。\n那知冥寞客，不有补亡篇。\n斜月吊空壁，旅人难独眠。\n一生能几时，百虑来相煎。\n戚戚故交泪，幽幽长夜泉。\n已矣难重言，一言一潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}